.SH NAME
mouser\-shell\-integration \- Print the shell integration for zsh, bash or fish (directory reports and silent `cd` from commander; fuzzball docs/shell.md). Load it from your rc file: `eval "$(mouser shell\-integration zsh)"`, `eval "$(mouser shell\-integration bash)"` or `mouser shell\-integration fish | source`
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
